AB  - This study proposes proposes an enterprise-level chatbot system architecture based on the Coze platform and Doubao Large Language Model, successfully achieving three core functionalities: enterprise knowledge question-answering, intelligent floor guidance in multi-story buildings, and natural, continuous conversational voice output. The system innovatively integrates Coze’s powerful workflow orchestration capabilities with Doubao’s exceptional multimodal processing prowess, constructing a comprehensive, end-to-end intelligent solution covering “knowledge retrieval-path planning-voice interaction.” In terms of technical implementation, the system employs Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) technology to optimize enterprise knowledge base construction, utilizes a hierarchical dynamic network algorithm to enhance cross-floor path planning efficiency, and integrates ChatTTS real-time speech synthesis for high-quality voice interaction, all facilitated by Volcengine APIs to ensure low-latency communication across the entire pipeline. Experimental evaluations demonstrate that the system exhibits significant advantages in enterprise scenarios, with core metrics such as question-answering accuracy, navigation path rationality, and voice naturalness reaching industry-leading levels, outperforming traditional conversational systems in overall performance.
